{
  "id": "ss.relic.vine-roots",
  "name": "Deep roots",
  "description": "The find that makes the vine hold on. One stem above a soil line with four roots driving well past it \u2014 the object is the proportion, three quarters of the plant underground, because what the find buys is grip rather than growth. The soil line is drawn last and half transparent so the roots show through it: a root hidden under an opaque band is a root the slot cannot promise. Timber for what is buried and moss for the one stem that is not, which is the same split the weapon's own document uses, so a player who has seen the plant reads this without being told.",
